{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"agent_message","text":"The first timing run showed a path from the late comparator into fetch-address prediction through the indirect-landing mask. I removed that mask and added an assertion for the pipeline invariant: a deferred branch in MEM cannot coincide with a registered JALR landing. Younger JALRs remain suppressed before landing capture. The new tests also exposed two monitor errors, which I’m correcting."}}
