 measured FPGA improvement. The reference run matched all\\nfive canonical CRCs and the required UART validation text.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"This core has no branch prediction: every taken conditional branch and every\\nJAL/JALR redirects from EX and discards the current fetch, even after a loop\\nor call site has executed many times. Its IF/ID bundle is combinational, so\\nthe actual penalty is one younger instr\n…[7450 of 10522 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:7e7868f6e9787462]…\n a flush.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add branch_predictor.sv to the test runner's explicit source list and add directed predictor recovery and backpressure cases that check architectural retirement and wrong-path side effects; retain the existing pipeline checks.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 13.26, \"delta_pct\": 9.41, \"vs_baseline\": 9.41, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.579, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4208674, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 12907, \"ff\": 589, \"seeds\": [5.245, 5.579, 5.579], \"perturbations\": [[0, 5.245, 147], [1, 5.579, 153], [2, 5.579, 153]], \"lutram\": 52, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -185.654, \"arrival_ns\": 195.948, \"logic_cells\": 147, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 147, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T13:28:45.804898Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
