arding eligibility.'},\n {'file':'rtl/ex_stage.sv','description':'Replace encoded-select case muxes with parallel masked-OR forwarding. Fuse PC/immediate substitution into four-source ALU operand masks so it adds no second wide mux. Keep architectural operands separately for branches, JALR, stores and RVFI; retain all pipeline and divider controls.'},\n {'file':'rtl/core.sv','description':'Widen the two internal forwarding select wires and module connections to carry three one-hot enables. Preserve top-level ports and every pipeline, hazard and RVFI connection.'},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'Retain all tests and strengthen overlapping-writer priority, both-source forwarding, x0, forwarded branch/store/JALR and held-WB stall cases. Check architectural RVFI operands/results and exact-once retirement/memory side effects.'}]\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h,sort_keys=False,width=88))\nprint(p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-001-r3s0.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
