{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema,xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-001-r3s0.yaml')\nh=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nh['expected_impact']={'fitness_delta_pct':5,'confidence':'high'}\nh['hypothesis']=h['hypothesis'].replace('The 12% gain is a timing\\\\nprediction pending vendor measurement; marked CoreMark cycles should stay\\\\nat 4,491,485, and acceptance requires more than 4.6% median fitness gain.\\\\nDo not carry forward the unsuccessful invalid-payload probe.','A temporary implementation of this exact mux rewrite produced a 5.18%\\\\nmedian Fmax gain and unchanged marked CoreMark cycles, just above the\\\\n4.6% acceptance threshold. Do not carry forward the unsuccessful\\\\ninvalid-payload probe. Avoid unrelated changes that could erase this\\\\nmeasured margin.')\nh['hypothesis']+='''\\\\nThe isolated prototype was checked with the actual evaluator's Gowin flow\\\\nand unchanged single-retire timed wrapper and stall generator. A fresh\\\\nchampion rebuild reproduced placement Fmax values 43.259, 44.029 and\\\\n44.029 MHz. The parallel-mux prototype produced 46.901, 46.308 and\\\\n46.308 MHz, median 46.308 MHz (+5.18%). Logic cells increased from 2,908\\\\nto 2,945; registers stayed at 597, with unchanged LUT-RAM, BSRAM and DSP\\\\ncounts. The option-0 worst arrival fell from 28.411 to 26.616 ns and\\\\nnow ends at divider launch rather than returning through IF/hazard/ID.\\\\n\\\\nThe existing pipeline cocotb suite passed. Full retirement-trace cosim\\\\npassed selftest and all three random programs both with ready-high buses\\\\nand with random instruction/data stalls, eight checks total. Canonical\\\\nstalled CoreMark passed all five CRCs, the required UART validation\\\\nliteral, bounded-access and termination checks. Its markers remained\\\\n15,801 and 4,507,286, exactly 4,491,485 measured cycles for ten iterations.\\\\nPrototype fitness is 103.10 iterations/second versus the champion's\\\\n98.03. These are measurements of a temporary candidate implementation;\\\\nthe orchestrator must still implement this proposal and run every gate.\\\\nThe prototype changed only forward_unit.sv, ex_stage.sv and core.sv.\\\\n'''\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nroot=ET.parse('/srv/hwebench/tmp/555e5898/6fc55ba4/r3s0-onehot/test/test_pipeline_runner.result.xml').getroot()\nprint('Pipeline cases:',len(list(root.iter('testcase'))))\nprint('Updated schema-valid hypothesis:',p)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
