ly 4,491,485 measured cycles for ten iterations.\\\\nPrototype fitness is 103.10 iterations/second versus the champion's\\\\n98.03. These are measurements of a temporary candidate implementation;\\\\nthe orchestrator must still implement this proposal and run every gate.\\\\nThe prototype changed only forward_unit.sv, ex_stage.sv and core.sv.\\\\n'''\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nroot=ET.parse('/srv/hwebench/tmp/555e5898/6fc55ba4/r3s0-onehot/test/test_pipeline_runner.result.xml').getroot()\nprint('Pipeline cases:',len(list(root.iter('testcase'))))\nprint('Updated schema-valid hypothesis:',p)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Pipeline cases: 18\nUpdated schema-valid hypothesis: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-001-r3s0.yaml\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
