{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"agent_message","text":"The register-file probe also preserves CoreMark cycles and passes the pipeline tests, but reaches only 44.954 MHz for one placement. Its worst path still crosses the fetch NOP mux into register reads. The two probes expose complementary limits at the same operand boundary, so I’m checking explicit register storage together with validity-only squash control as one structural change."}}
