ns afterward; unsigned operations use operands directly.\\n\\nUnroll 16 stages, each consuming two dividend bits. Precompute D, 2D,\\nand 3D once as 34-bit unsigned values. Each stage forms T=4*R+next_two_bits and\\ncomputes T-D, T-2D, and T-3D in parallel. Derive the three fit predicates\\nfrom the extended subtract results' borrow bit\n…[143663 of 146735 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a496fd1d58546037]…\nelta_pct\": 12.21, \"vs_baseline\": 1230.78, \"fmax_mhz\": 66.311, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4111263, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4687, \"ff\": 1804, \"seeds\": [62.66, 66.311, 66.311], \"perturbations\": [[0, 62.66, 19], [1, 66.311, 19], [2, 66.311, 19]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/divisor_q_16_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/quotient_q_0_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -10.959, \"arrival_ns\": 21.253, \"logic_cells\": 21, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 19, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T18:20:30.965715Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 7, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-003-r7s2 (regression, +12.21%): Four-entry predictor-directed fetch queuing overlaps instruction acquisition with load-use/M-engine holds while retaining M-engine latency and serial divider arithmetic, so its 12.21% CoreMark gain trails the 15.39% gain from parallel divider trials.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
