unsigned operations use operands directly.\\n\\nUnroll 16 stages, each consuming two dividend bits. Precompute D, 2D,\\nand 3D once as 34-bit unsigned values. Each stage forms T=4*R+next_two_bits and\\ncomputes T-D, T-2D, and T-3D in parallel. Derive the three fit predicates\\nfrom the extended subtract results' borrow bit\n…[270181 of 273253 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a834399a94c1ffae]…\nement\", \"fitness\": 179.84, \"delta_pct\": 8.43, \"vs_baseline\": 1383.83, \"fmax_mhz\": 73.936, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4111263, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5903, \"ff\": 2038, \"seeds\": [72.628, 73.936, 73.936], \"perturbations\": [[0, 72.628, 16], [1, 73.936, 16], [2, 73.936, 16]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/magnitude_b_q_1_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/remainder_q_1_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -8.769, \"arrival_ns\": 19.063, \"logic_cells\": 21, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T19:57:03.844219Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 8, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-003-r8s2 (improvement, +8.43%): Separating fetch-queue occupancy/PC recovery from packed payload-bank writes keeps EX correction out of wide write enables, preserving Fmax while prediction-guided acquisition during decode holds cuts CoreMark stalls.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
