hile counters change, corrections during each hold reason, exact-once effects and complete RVFI PC/order/operand checks.'}\n ]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=95,default_flow_style=False))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Revised, schema-valid hypothesis:',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Revised, schema-valid hypothesis: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-003-r9s2.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
