gic_cells\": 25, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider\"]}}\n{\"id\": \"hyp-20261001-003-r4s2\", \"title\": \"Static backward-taken prediction with one-bit recovery\", \"fitness\": 121.32, \"delta_pct\": 12.46, \"fmax_mhz\": 51.68, \"cycles\": 4259699, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_4_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/remainder_q_0_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -14.478, \"arrival_ns\": 24.772, \"logic_cells\": 21, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider\"]}}\nHYPOTHESIS: Add a stateless backward-taken/forward-not-taken direct-control\npredictor to the current champion. Predict a legal conditional branch\ntaken exactly when its signed B immediate is negative (instruction\nbit 31); predict legal JAL taken; predict all other instructions,\nincluding JALR, sequentially. Recognize BRANCH only for funct3 values\n{0,1,4,5,6,7}. Suppre\n…[19705 of 22777 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a6951b68e2ac17f1]…\nars this target, with a limited margin that requires\npreserving the measured topology during implementation.\nThe new fetch-address mux, ID alternate-PC arithmetic and remaining\ndivider/ALU/queue routing are the main timing risks.\n\nNOTES: \n{\"id\": \"hyp-20261002-003-r12s2\", \"title\": \"Parallel operand reads for the prediction-guided fetch queue\", \"fitness\": 200.56, \"delta_pct\": -7.35, \"fmax_mhz\": 81.267, \"cycles\": 4052037, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_4_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/resident_pc_q_10_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -8.319, \"arrival_ns\": 18.613, \"logic_cells\": 38, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}}\n{\"id\": \"hyp-20261002-003-r13s2\", \"title\": \"One-bit local correlation with a cached agreement lookup\", \"fitness\": 202.95, \"delta_pct\": -6.25, \"fmax_mhz\": 81.152, \"cycles\": 3998554, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_val_2_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/count_q